{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Leave Here\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a walking simulator game. When you wake up from a hangover, you are in a strange corridor. You need to keep walking down, collect information, solve puzzles, and leave here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Story Background\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a hangover, you wake up and find yourself on the top floor of an apartment building, so you want to go down and leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, gradually, you find that things are not that simple. This staircase seems to have no end...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What's worse is that there seems to be more than one person in this corridor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/1.gif?t=1743487858\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Game Features\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Unreal 5 engine brings realistic horror visual and auditory effects, immersive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Realistic operation and interactive simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7 Layered interaction and narrative, creepy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/extras/2.gif?t=1743487858\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623270?t=1743487858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/d3fda8e6798e48e10348e08b1987a350b1f83135/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743487858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/27bc14a5124848b604b97dc3ca376bdbe6fbb9a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743487858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623270/27bc14a5124848b604b97dc3ca376bdbe6fbb9a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743487858","categories":[{"de